# Default apps for file types, applied by init.py with duti (brew install duti).
# Format: <bundle id> <.ext or UTI> <role>. Find a bundle id with:
#   osascript -e 'id of app "Visual Studio Code"'
# Check what opens a type now: duti -x md
# Extensions with no registered type (e.g. .toml) fail with error -50; set
# those once in Finder instead: Get Info > Open with > Change All.
com.microsoft.VSCode  .md    all
com.microsoft.VSCode  .txt   all
com.microsoft.VSCode  .json  all
com.microsoft.VSCode  .yaml  all
com.microsoft.VSCode  .yml   all
com.microsoft.VSCode  .sh    all
com.microsoft.VSCode  .py    all
com.microsoft.VSCode  .ts    all
